    <!-- 14. VOICE ENGINE -->
    <h2 id="voice-engine">14. The Voice Engine</h2>

    <p>Everything you publish goes through a voice system that ensures it sounds like you — not like generic SEO copy, not like an influencer, not like a content farm.</p>

    <h3>Components</h3>
    <table class="admin-table" style="margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Component</th><th>File</th><th>What It Does</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Voice Profile</strong></td><td><code>voice-profile.md</code></td><td>Your tone, rhythm, vocabulary, and editorial positioning codified as a reusable reference</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Voice Rules</strong></td><td><code>voice-rules.json</code></td><td>Structured config: 30+ blocked words, 28 blocked phrases, 8 regex patterns, preferred constructions, scoring weights</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Prompt Templates</strong></td><td><code>prompts/</code> directory</td><td>13 content-type and channel-specific templates that condition AI output</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Voice Validator</strong></td><td><code>src/voice-validator.js</code></td><td>Two-layer scoring: instant rule-based check + optional LLM-based deep analysis</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>Prompt templates available</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Blog:</strong> restaurant-guide, style-guide, travel-guide, hotel-review, recipe, the-edit</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> weekly-edit</li>
      <li><strong>Social:</strong> instagram-caption, pinterest-pin</li>
      <li><strong>SEO:</strong> meta-description</li>
      <li><strong>Editorial:</strong> brief-generator, refresh-suggestions</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Voice validation scoring</h3>
    <p><strong>Layer 1 (rule-based, instant):</strong> Checks blocklist words/phrases, exclamation marks, hedging language, sentence rhythm variety, paragraph length, preferred vocabulary usage. Returns a 0-100 score.</p>
    <p><strong>Layer 2 (LLM-based, optional):</strong> Scores tone (0-20), specificity (0-20), rhythm (0-20), confidence (0-20), and anti-patterns (0-20). Total 0-100.</p>
    <p><strong>75+ is publish-ready.</strong> Below 75, revise. Below 50, rewrite.</p>

    <h3>Blocked language examples</h3>
    <p>The voice engine blocks words like: vibes, hack, obsessed, game-changer, slay, nestled, boasts, plethora, delve, "let's dive in", "comprehensive guide", "look no further", "without further ado", "it's important to note." These are the hallmarks of generic content. Your voice doesn't use them.</p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); margin: 3rem 0;" />

