    <!-- 19. 50K ROADMAP -->
    <h2 id="50k-roadmap">19. The 50K Session Roadmap</h2>

    <p>The goal: 50,000 monthly sessions to qualify for Mediavine premium display ads. Here's the 6-month plan.</p>

    <table class="admin-table" style="margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Month</th><th>New Posts</th><th>Total Posts</th><th>Target Sessions</th><th>Focus</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 1</strong></td><td>12</td><td>16</td><td>~1,000</td><td>Foundation — low-difficulty keywords across all pillars</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 2</strong></td><td>12</td><td>28</td><td>3,000-5,000</td><td>Fill gaps — cluster depth, every destination gets 3+ posts</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 3</strong></td><td>12</td><td>40</td><td>8,000-12,000</td><td>Authority — attack competitive keywords, create mega guides</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 4</strong></td><td>12</td><td>52</td><td>15,000-20,000</td><td>Refresh Month 1 posts + summer content + FAQ sections</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 5</strong></td><td>12</td><td>64</td><td>25,000-35,000</td><td>Pinterest at scale — 400+ pins live, 10-15/day</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Month 6</strong></td><td>12</td><td>76</td><td>40,000-50,000</td><td>Push to 50K — striking-distance keyword optimization</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>Pinterest strategy</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>8 pin variations per post (via <code>aileen pins</code>)</li>
      <li>5-10 pins per day, increasing to 10-15 by Month 5</li>
      <li>Boards: Luxury Travel Guides, Timeless Style, Where to Eat, Elegant Recipes, Intentional Living</li>
      <li>Enable article rich pins via Open Graph (already implemented)</li>
      <li>Join 5-10 relevant group boards in months 2-3</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>SEO refresh cycle</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Month 4: audit all Month 1 posts, update internal links, add FAQ sections</li>
      <li>Ongoing: use GSC to find "striking distance" keywords (positions 5-20) and optimize</li>
      <li>Stale content alert on the Editorial Dashboard flags posts not updated in 90+ days</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Track progress on the <a href={`${base}/admin/performance/`}>Performance Dashboard</a>.</p>

