    <!-- 22. FLYWHEEL -->
    <h2 id="flywheel">22. The Flywheel</h2>

    <p>Every piece of this system feeds the next:</p>

    <ol>
      <li><strong>Your voice</strong> produces consistent, branded content that readers trust and return to</li>
      <li><strong>Content</strong> is placed into clusters by destination and type, building topical depth</li>
      <li><strong>Clusters</strong> build topical authority that Google rewards with higher rankings</li>
      <li><strong>Rankings</strong> drive organic traffic that you don't pay for</li>
      <li><strong>Traffic</strong> converts to email subscribers (newsletter) and affiliate revenue (product/booking/reservation clicks)</li>
      <li><strong>Data</strong> from analytics and dashboards tells you what's working and what to write next</li>
      <li><strong>The refresh loop</strong> keeps old content earning — nothing rots, everything compounds</li>
      <li><strong>At 50K sessions</strong>, Mediavine display ads add a significant passive revenue stream</li>
    </ol>

    <p>Each loop makes the next one faster. That's the flywheel. That's what this entire platform is built to do.</p>

